  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "According to the BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\n**Option 1 :** 5 and 14\n\nGiven:\n\n14 + 32 - 56 ÷ 28 × 5 = 40\n\nAfter interchange the signs;\n\n__\n \n• 5 + 32 - ***56 ÷ 28__*** × 14 = 40\n \n• By BODMAS rule\n \n• 5 + 32 - ***__2 × 14__*** = 40\n \n• ***__5 + 32__*** - 28 = 40\n \n• 37 – 28 = 40\n \n• 9 = 40 **(LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n**Option 2 :** 28 and 32\n\nGiven: \n\n14 + 32 - 56 ÷ 28 × 5 = 40\n\nAfter interchange the signs;\n\n__\n \n• 14 + 28 - ***56 ÷ 32__*** × 5 = 40\n \n• By BODMAS rule\n \n• 14 + 28 – ***__1.75 × 5__*** = 40\n \n• ***__14 + 28__*** – 8.75 = 40\n \n• 42 – 8.75 = 40\n \n• 33.25 = 40 **(LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n**Option 3: **14 and 32\n\nGiven:\n\n14 + 32 - 56 ÷ 28 × 5 = 40\n\nAfter interchange the signs;\n\n__\n \n• 32 + 14 - ***56 ÷ 28__*** × 5 = 40\n \n• By BODMAS rule\n \n• 32 + 14 - ***__2 × 5__*** = 40\n \n• ***__32 + 14 __***– 10 = 40\n \n• ***__46 – 10__*** = 40\n \n• 36 = 40 **(LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n**Option 4: 28 and 14**\n\n**Given:**\n\n**14 + 32 - 56 ÷ 28 × 5 = 40**\n\n**After interchange the signs;**\n\n__\n \n• **28 + 32 - *56 ÷ 14__* × 5 = 40**\n \n• **By BODMAS rule**\n \n• **28 + 32 - *__4 × 5__* = 40**\n \n• ***__28 + 32__***** - 20 = 40**\n \n• ***__60 – 20__***** = 40**\n \n• **40 = 40** **(LHS = RHS)**\n\nHence, the answer is **“****28 and 14”.**",
